  "answer_text": "Here are the contact details for **Advance Auto Parts Human Resources**:\n\n\ud83d\udcde **HR Support Center Phone Number:**\n**1-800-380-4681**\n\n\ud83d\udce7 **HR Support Center Email:**\n**HRSupportCenter@advance-auto.com**\n\n\ud83d\udcde **Additional HR Contact Number:**\n**540-362-4911** \u2013 This is listed as a primary contact number to reach the HR department for employment-related inquiries.\n\n\ud83d\udd50 **Business Hours:**\nWhen contacting Advance Auto Parts Human Resources, make sure to call during regular business hours. The HR department is typically available from **10:00 AM to 5:00 PM, Monday through Friday**, excluding public holidays.\n\nWhether you're a current employee or a prospective candidate, calling the HR number can help with matters such as **job applications, employee benefits, interview scheduling, and workplace policies.**\n\n> **Tip:** To make the most of your call, have your information ready. If you are a current employee, be sure to provide your employee ID or other identifying information. If you are a job seeker, be prepared to mention the position you are applying for or the date you submitted your application.",
